  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covid-19: Rapid-Response Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) Stockpile for the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity has been created to purchase and preposition Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) and medical supplies in New&#xA0;Zealand to enable a rapid response in the event of a significant outbreak of Covid-19 in the Pacific.</narrative>
